<title>FRANCE: France leaves 97 beet sowings estimate unchanged.</title>
<headline>France leaves 97 beet sowings estimate unchanged.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-06-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>France's farm ministry on Wednesday left its estimate for 1997 sugar beet sowings unchanged from last month at 454,000 hectares.</p>
<p>This would represent a drop of 0.9 percent from 458,000 hectares in 1996.</p>
<p>-- Paris newsroom +331 4221 5432</p>
</text>
